Thank you all for being part of the Early AccessːpaperheartːːpraisesunːːMHRISE_happyː We’ve prepared a new Update. Please check the change list belowːSocialPolicyː

Change list

 Added Halftime Minigames into the game:

    Murderball Mayhem - NEW Halftime Minigame where players need to pass the murderball back and forth between 2 QBs while trying to eliminate as many Refs as possible before time runs out! Look out for rare Golden Refs to score more points. Try combining kills to get even more points, but watch out for Orc Refs who will try to kill your Quarterbacks!
    Field Goal Frenzy - NEW Halftime Minigame where players need to kick field goals to rack up the highest score before time runs out! Keep your kicker alive by scoring points to reset the landmine detonator beneath his feet!
    Ref Rampage - return of the beloved one and only Halftime Minigame from the MFL1!

 Roster Updates to reflect 2025 Draft, the latest major trades and roster cuts;
 Bug Fixes and Improvements:

    Fixed an issue that caused the game to be stuck after opening the Player Trades/Free Agents screen;
    Resolved incorrect player count messages on the field;
    Fixed hazard icons not displaying properly during arena intros;
    Fixed game lockup when returning to Quick Game after creating a custom team;
    The Enforcer position now shows the correct diagram icon;
    Fixed short screen freezes when navigating back to Season Mode from Depth Chart;
    Resolved issue where controllers wouldn’t respond if the game was launched with keyboard input;
    Music volume now properly applies when editing a previously created team in Season Mode;
    Fixed a bug where game continued after canceling a trade or free-agent signing;
    Removed excessive fade effects when switching between the Main Menu and specific Game Modes dashboards elements;
 Various additional bug fixes and performance improvements.


That’s it for now, Mutantsːsummercat2023ːːsummercrab2023ːːsummerfish2023ːːsummerparrot2023ːːOrcHateːːorccaptainːːpaperdeathːːlunar2020halodragonːːer_waveː
